{
  "lessonId": "L1M2L4",
  "title": "Sicily 西西里島 - 地中海瑰寶",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d35400 0%,#e67e22 100%)'><h1>🌋 Sicily 西西里島</h1><p class='subtitle'>火山土壤上的千年酒文化</p></section><section class='slide sicily-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='sicily-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='sicily-map' class='sicily-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#e67e22;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌋 Sicily 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #e67e22'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>火山土壤上的千年酒文化</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #d4af37'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#d4af37;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#d4af37'>Etna DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>義大利的勃根地，火山風土</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(192,57,43,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #c0392b'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#c0392b;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#c0392b'>Cerasuolo di Vittoria DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>西西里唯一DOCG</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#f39c12;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #f39c12;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(243,156,18,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #f39c12'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#f39c12;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#f39c12'>Marsala DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>歷史悠久的加烈酒</p></div><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(230,126,34,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #e67e22'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#e67e22;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#e67e22'>Faro DOC</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>東北部精品紅酒</p></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#95a5a6;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #95a5a6;padding-bottom:8px'>💎 B級產區</h4><div style='margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(149,165,166,.1);border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #95a5a6'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#95a5a6;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#95a5a6'>Noto, Pantelleria, Alcamo</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>區域特色產區</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏝️ 地理特色</h2><div class='geo-highlights'><div class='geo-card volcano'><div class='geo-icon'>🌋</div><h3>Etna 火山</h3><p>歐洲最活躍火山</p><p><strong>3,329 公尺</strong></p><p>火山土壤賦予獨特礦物風味</p></div><div class='geo-card climate'><div class='geo-icon'>☀️</div><h3>地中海氣候</h3><p>炎熱乾燥的夏季</p><p><strong>300+ 天日照</strong></p><p>海風調節溫度</p></div><div class='geo-card area'><div class='geo-icon'>🌾</div><h3>義大利最大島</h3><p>面積 25,711 km²</p><p><strong>~105,000 ha</strong> 葡萄園</p><p>產量全義第一</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 特色品種</h2><div class='grape-profiles'><div class='grape red-grape'><div class='grape-header'><h3>🔴 Nero d'Avola</h3><span class='grape-tag'>西西里之王</span></div><div class='grape-body'><p><strong>風味：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、巧克力、香料</p><p><strong>結構：</strong>單寧堅實、酒體飽滿</p><p><strong>適飲溫度：</strong>16-18°C</p><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>5-15 年（頂級）</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong>烤肉、茄汁燉菜、陳年起司</p></div></div><div class='grape white-grape'><div class='grape-header'><h3>⚪ Grillo</h3><span class='grape-tag'>白酒新星</span></div><div class='grape-body'><p><strong>風味：</strong>檸檬、白桃、杏仁、礦物</p><p><strong>結構：</strong>清爽酸度、中等酒體</p><p><strong>適飲溫度：</strong>8-10°C</p><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>2-5 年</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong>海鮮、沙拉、炸海鮮</p></div></div><div class='grape volcanic-grape'><div class='grape-header'><h3>🔴 Nerello Mascalese</h3><span class='grape-tag'>Etna 之魂</span></div><div class='grape-body'><p><strong>風味：</strong>紅櫻桃、草本、火山礦物</p><p><strong>結構：</strong>優雅單寧、高酸度</p><p><strong>適飲溫度：</strong>14-16°C</p><p><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>10-20 年</p><p><strong>搭配：</strong>野味、蘑菇、烤蔬菜</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 核心產區</h2><div class='appellation-grid'><div class='aoc-item etna'><div class='aoc-badge'>DOCG</div><h3>Etna DOC</h3><div class='aoc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>Etna 火山坡</p><p><strong>海拔：</strong>400-1,100 公尺</p><p><strong>主要品種：</strong>Nerello Mascalese (紅), Carricante (白)</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>優雅、高酸、礦物感</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>被譽為「義大利的勃根地」</p></div></div><div class='aoc-item cerasuolo'><div class='aoc-badge'>DOCG</div><h3>Cerasuolo di Vittoria DOCG</h3><div class='aoc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>島嶼東南部</p><p><strong>品種：</strong>Nero d'Avola + Frappato</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>中等酒體、櫻桃風味</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>西西里唯一 DOCG</p></div></div><div class='aoc-item marsala'><div class='aoc-badge'>DOC</div><h3>Marsala DOC</h3><div class='aoc-details'><p><strong>位置：</strong>島嶼西端</p><p><strong>類型：</strong>加烈甜酒</p><p><strong>風格：</strong>乾型到甜型都有</p><p><strong>用途：</strong>餐後酒、烹飪</p><p><strong>特點：</strong>歷史悠久（1773年起）</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Etna 葡萄酒的獨特性</h2><div class='uniqueness-section'><div class='unique-feature'><h4>🌋 火山土壤</h4><p>富含礦物質的火山灰土壤，賦予葡萄酒獨特的鹹鮮感和礦物風味</p></div><div class='unique-feature'><h4>⛰️ 高海拔</h4><p>400-1,100 公尺的海拔高度，帶來涼爽氣候和顯著的日夜溫差</p></div><div class='unique-feature'><h4>🎯 精細分區</h4><p>不同坡面（Contrade）展現微妙的風土差異，如同勃根地的 Climat</p></div><div class='unique-feature'><h4>🌳 老藤傳統</h4><p>許多葡萄園保留百年老藤，採用傳統的 Alberello（樹形）栽培</p></div></div><div class='comparison-box'><h4>💡 Etna vs Burgundy 對比</h4><table><tr><th>特點</th><th>Etna</th><th>Burgundy</th></tr><tr><td>主要紅品種</td><td>Nerello Mascalese</td><td>Pinot Noir</td></tr><tr><td>風格</td><td>優雅、高酸、礦物</td><td>優雅、高酸、細膩</td></tr><tr><td>土壤</td><td>火山土</td><td>石灰岩</td></tr><tr><td>分區概念</td><td>Contrade</td><td>Climat</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 經典配餐</h2><div class='food-pairings'><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🔴 Nero d'Avola</h4><ul><li>🍖 西西里烤羊肉</li><li>🍝 茄汁燉茄子（Caponata）</li><li>🧀 Pecorino 陳年起司</li><li>🍕 厚餅 Pizza</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>⚪ Grillo</h4><ul><li>🦑 炸花枝圈</li><li>🐟 烤劍魚</li><li>🍋 檸檬海鮮沙拉</li><li>🥗 希臘沙拉</li></ul></div><div class='pairing-card'><h4>🔴 Nerello Mascalese</h4><ul><li>🍄 松露野菇燉飯</li><li>🦆 烤鴨胸</li><li>🥩 炭烤牛排</li><li>🌿 香草烤蔬菜</li></ul></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Sicily 是義大利最大產酒島，產量全國第一</div><div class='point'>✓ Etna 火山土壤創造獨一無二的礦物風味</div><div class='point'>✓ Nero d'Avola 是西西里代表性紅葡萄品種</div><div class='point'>✓ Etna DOC 被譽為「義大利的勃根地」</div><div class='point'>✓ Cerasuolo di Vittoria 是西西里唯一 DOCG</div></div></section></div><style>.geo-highlights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin:25px 0}.geo-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transition:transform .3s}.geo-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}.geo-icon{font-size:3.5rem;margin-bottom:15px}.geo-card h3{margin:10px 0;color:#d35400;font-size:1.3rem}.geo-card p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#555}.geo-card strong{color:#e67e22;font-size:1.2rem}.grape-profiles{display:grid;gap:20px}.grape{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.grape-header{padding:20px;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.red-grape .grape-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#e74c3c)}.white-grape .grape-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f39c12,#f1c40f)}.volcanic-grape .grape-header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#34495e,#7f8c8d)}.grape-header h3{margin:0;font-size:1.3rem}.grape-tag{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);padding:5px 15px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600}.grape-body{padding:25px}.grape-body p{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.8}.grape-body strong{color:#2c3e50}.appellation-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.aoc-item{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);position:relative}.aoc-badge{position:absolute;top:15px;right:15px;background:#e74c3c;color:#fff;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.aoc-item h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.2rem}.aoc-details p{margin:8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-size:.95rem}.aoc-details strong{color:#2c3e50}.uniqueness-section{display:grid;gap:15px;margin-bottom:25px}.unique-feature{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffeaa7,#fdcb6e);padding:18px 24px;border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #e67e22}.unique-feature h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:#d35400}.unique-feature p{margin:0;color:#2c3e50;line-height:1.6}.comparison-box{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.comparison-box h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#d35400}.comparison-box table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem}.comparison-box th{background:#e67e22;color:#fff;padding:12px;text-align:left}.comparison-box td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0}.comparison-box tr:hover{background:#fef5e7}.food-pairings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.pairing-card{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #e67e22;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.pairing-card h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#d35400;font-size:1.2rem}.pairing-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2.2}.pairing-card li{color:#2c3e50}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffeaa7,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #e67e22;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style><style>.map-slide-container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:30px;height:calc(100vh - 200px);min-height:500px;padding:20px}.sicily-region-map{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);background:#1a1a2e}.map-legend{background:rgba(26,26,46,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:12px;padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);height:fit-content;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Sicily 西西里島上最著名的火山是？",
      "options": [
        "Vesuvius",
        "Etna",
        "Stromboli",
        "Vulcano"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Etna 火山是歐洲最活躍的火山，其火山土壤賦予 Etna DOC 葡萄酒獨特的礦物風味。"
    },
    {
      "question": "西西里的代表性紅葡萄品種是？",
      "options": [
        "Sangiovese",
        "Nebbiolo",
        "Nero d'Avola",
        "Barbera"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Nero d'Avola 是西西里最重要的紅葡萄品種，被稱為「西西里之王」。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Etna DOC 的主要紅葡萄品種是？",
      "options": [
        "Nero d'Avola",
        "Nerello Mascalese",
        "Frappato",
        "Aglianico"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Nerello Mascalese 是 Etna DOC的主要紅葡萄品種，風格優雅，常被比作義大利的黑皮諾。"
    },
    {
      "question": "西西里唯一的 DOCG 產區是？",
      "options": [
        "Etna DOCG",
        "Marsala DOCG",
        "Cerasuolo di Vittoria DOCG",
        "Faro DOCG"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explanation": "Cerasuolo di Vittoria DOCG 是西西里島唯一的 DOCG 產區，使用 Nero d'Avola 和 Frappato 混釀。"
    }
  ]
}
